  "term": "borderline disorder",
  "definition": "Borderline disorder, described here as borderline personality disorder, is a severe and complex mental disorder. The packet supports that it can involve differing patterns of emotions and behavior, such as anger, impulsivity, emptiness, affective instability, and self-harm or suicidality, and that its presentation may vary across genders.",
